@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Get overview metrics, recent bookings, and bookings created per day over the last seven days
GET {{baseUrl}}/Overview?date=2026-11-05

### Filter bookings by booking creation date and sort by booking ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Booking?bookingDate=2026-10-31&sortBy=id&sortDirection=asc&page=1&pageSize=10

### Sort bookings by booking creation date descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/Booking?sortBy=bookingDate&sortDirection=desc&page=1&pageSize=10

### Get the overview for one hotel
GET {{baseUrl}}/Overview/hotel/1?date=2026-11-05

### Get the overview for a hotel that does not exist
GET {{baseUrl}}/Overview/hotel/999999?date=2026-11-05

### Get an aggregated monthly inventory calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/Inventory/calendar?hotelId=1&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30

### Get the calendar for one room type
GET {{baseUrl}}/Inventory/calendar?hotelId=1&roomId=1&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
